From 32c7923d48fbc339c047858c2c40df6458d96112 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yooz <136268860+y-o-o-z@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:15:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] local: shellter web theme in the colors of shellter.me,
 rank-colored nick modes

- theme 'tahio' becomes 'shellter' (client/themes/shellter.css, assets in
  themes/shellter/): shellter.me tokens 1:1, light (cream #faf8f4, rust
  #b45309) and dark (#0b0d10, amber #f59e0b - the terminal shellter theme)
  chosen by the system like shellter.me's 'system' mode
- wordmark '$ erssi@tahio' with the prompt in the accent color, as
  '$shellter.me'; sign-in page with the same tokens and a dark variant,
  the IRCnet map panel in the shellter.me dark palette
- the nick mode prefix is its own element (.user-mode[data-mode]), colored
  by rank like $nickmode in the terminal: @ op, + voice, % halfop, ~ & owner
- nick colors from the shellter palette (darker variants on light)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
